/**
    @file
    The toolkit's namespaces, documented once each for the source documentation (the Doxyfile reads this file).
    Doxygen lists nothing of an undocumented namespace's free functions and constants, and warns of none of them, so
    every namespace the toolkit opens has its line here unless the header that opens it documents it itself. A product
    documents its own namespaces in its own tree. One is left out on purpose: reckless::audio::test::suite, the device
    suites' harness (tests/devices/DeviceSuite.h), whose helpers are the suites' cases' and, like a test case, are
    documented by their names and the tables they print.
*/

/** @namespace reckless
    The toolkit: the namespaces of the core, the drawing layer, the
    look, the views, the panel, the windows, the app's platform, the audio device layer, the network, the update check
    and the licence. */

/** @namespace reckless::app
    An app's platform layer (app/): the application behind its platform seam, where a window goes, and the audio
    settings' widgets on the views; and an app's shell on it - its window and loop, its root, its theme, its widgets,
    its resources and its update check. */

/** @namespace reckless::app::fonts
    An app's fonts: the series' serif at the series' sizes (app/AppTheme.h). */

/** @namespace reckless::audio
    The audio device layer (audio/): a back end of the toolkit's own for every device API on every platform, the
    settings an app keeps and a device with no hardware. */

/** @namespace reckless::audio::test
    The device suite's rigs: a deterministic test device on each real audio API (tests/devices). */

/** @namespace reckless::audio::wasapi
    Windows Audio's arithmetic that needs no Windows: the modes' names, the encodings and their conversion, the
    periods and the capture ring (audio/win/WasapiFormats.h). */

/** @namespace reckless::core
    The core (core/): JSON, UTF-8, numbers to and from text in any locale, the user's files and folders, the
    interface's preferences, audio files, and what an audio thread and its display share. */

/** @namespace reckless::core::json
    The one form everything saved takes: a JSON value, its plain writer and its strict RFC 8259 reader. */

/** @namespace reckless::core::json::detail
    The JSON writer's internals. */

/** @namespace reckless::core::presets
    The preset files: one JSON document per preset in a folder per product, and the platform's folders they and the
    settings live in. */

/** @namespace reckless::core::utf8
    UTF-8 stepped, measured and checked for well-formedness. */

/** @namespace reckless::embedded
    A binary's embedded files - the serif, the mark, a product's face plates - found by name at run time
    (cmake/RecklessEmbed.cmake writes the table). */

/** @namespace reckless::gfx
    The drawing layer (gfx/), header only: geometry, colour, paths, text, the canvas and the meters' artwork, with
    Skia beneath it in gfx/skia. */

/** @namespace reckless::gfx::colors
    Named colours every canvas knows. */

/** @namespace reckless::gfx::detail
    The drawing layer's internals. */

/** @namespace reckless::licence
    The licence (licence/): its text and its Ed25519 signature checked against the public keys a build holds, offline,
    the licence a machine keeps for every product on it, and the build's demo switch. */

/** @namespace reckless::look
    The series' look (look/): its metrics and palettes, and every piece of it drawn on a canvas - the knob, the plates,
    the header, the lamps, the tubes, the meters, the scope and the tone stack's schematic. */

/** @namespace reckless::look::tone_stack_detail
    The tone stack schematic's drawing metrics, in design pixels. */

/** @namespace reckless::net
    The network (net/): an HTTP exchange on the platform's own stack - NSURLSession, WinHTTP, libcurl loaded by name -
    with redirects followed by the browsers' rule, URLs and forms, SHA-256 and base64url, the system's random bytes,
    and a one-shot listener on the loopback interface for a sign-in's redirect. */

/** @namespace reckless::panel
    The series' panel on the views (panel/): the face every product's panel holds and its screens and meters. */

/** @namespace reckless::tempo
    The tempo divisions the synced LFOs and delays share: their beats, names and rates at a tempo. */

/** @namespace reckless::test
    What the toolkit's suites, and a product's built on them, share: measures, noise, scratch paths, a window of the
    platform's own and an HTTP server on the loopback interface. */

/** @namespace reckless::test::allocations
    A counting global operator new: the audio suites' count of a callback's allocations. */

/** @namespace reckless::update
    The update check (update/): whether a newer release is out, from a small manifest on the company's website, at
    most once a day per machine and only while a window shows; a product's description and the one factory its
    checker comes from; and the Updates menu every product offers. */

/** @namespace reckless::view
    The views (view/), header only: the view tree and its mouse routing, and every control, menu, dialog and layout a
    panel is built from. */

/** @namespace reckless::view::tooltip
    The tooltip's text: words split, trimmed and wrapped to the balanced lines a tooltip draws. */

/** @namespace reckless::window
    The child window a panel is shown in (window/), written against no toolkit, and the shell at the root of every
    window. */
